01:27:41.340 --> 01:27:45.100
First, don't you think you should find that pledge stone you were looking for?

01:27:45.100 --> 01:27:46.950
All right, all right!

01:27:46.950 --> 01:27:49.120
Don't run away before this is over.

01:27:50.850 --> 01:27:54.470
It has to be here, somewhere in this mansion.

01:27:54.470 --> 01:27:57.300
We have to find the pledge stone.

01:30:53.900 --> 01:31:00.000
a monster and Halciform, who made the pledge of immortality with him, are trying to suck

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:07.710
our life energy. Why? What did we ever do to them? The only way to kill Halseform is to smash

01:31:07.710 --> 01:31:13.130
the Pledge Stone. We must find it. It must be somewhere in this mansion.

01:31:36.080 --> 01:31:36.980
