01:31:36.980 --> 01:31:42.430
No, something that looked like it.

01:31:42.430 --> 01:31:45.160
Place, we don't know what this pledge stone looks like.

01:31:45.160 --> 01:31:46.880
Just use your head.

01:31:46.880 --> 01:31:49.640
I'm sure we'll know the pledge stone when we see it.

01:31:49.640 --> 01:31:53.950
