01:32:04.360 --> 01:32:06.500
Okay, you two guys quit goofing off.

01:32:06.500 --> 01:32:08.160
You're impossible.

01:32:08.160 --> 01:32:09.470
Cheese.

01:32:09.470 --> 01:32:11.470
Hm?

01:32:11.470 --> 01:32:27.360
Hmm.

01:32:27.360 --> 01:32:28.360
What is it?

01:32:28.360 --> 01:32:29.800
What?

01:32:32.880 --> 01:32:37.460
suspicious isn't it so you think the pledge stone might be in here well that

01:32:37.460 --> 01:32:44.980
may be true or they all might just be regular stone statues right Lina huh

01:32:44.980 --> 01:32:50.110
wind which blows across eternity gather in my hand and be my strength

01:32:50.110 --> 01:32:56.240
glam gosh

01:33:11.550 --> 01:33:15.550
It's so much better now. I just had to get rid of all those creepy things.

01:33:15.550 --> 01:33:21.030
Yeah, right. What if this had been some sort of trap? You could have crushed all of us.

01:33:21.030 --> 01:33:23.430
We'll worry about that when it happens.

01:33:23.430 --> 01:33:26.970
Yeah, right. I figured.

01:33:26.970 --> 01:33:29.190
Oh, my.

01:33:30.570 --> 01:33:33.300
- It looks like you were right, Mr. Zelgatiss.

01:33:33.300 --> 01:33:36.890
- In this situation, I would definitely rather be wrong.

01:33:36.890 --> 01:33:38.190
- Well, if this is a trap,

01:33:38.190 --> 01:33:40.770
