01:33:44.170 --> 01:33:53.210
- You're wasting your time.

01:33:53.210 --> 01:33:56.620
You can search this mansion all you want,

01:33:56.620 --> 01:33:59.520
but you will never find the pledge stone.

01:33:59.520 --> 01:34:00.000
- Watch out.

01:34:00.120 --> 01:34:01.120
He's coming for us.

01:34:01.120 --> 01:34:16.790
Amelia!

01:34:17.790 --> 01:34:21.020
It didn't work!

01:34:21.020 --> 01:34:22.020
Shadow wave!

01:34:26.400 --> 01:34:27.620
