01:34:50.380 --> 01:34:51.740
She has such power.

01:34:52.810 --> 01:34:54.000
I must have it.

01:34:55.830 --> 01:34:58.520
A little longer, my dear.

01:34:58.990 --> 01:35:00.000
Just be patient.

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:16.490
A little longer rubia until we can smash the pledge stone the raw tilt won't work

01:35:16.710 --> 01:35:22.090
His spirit must be shielded on the astral plane was my killer spell -

01:35:22.810 --> 01:35:25.440
It's finding that stone our only chance

01:35:25.990 --> 01:35:30.000
Yes, which is why I said I can't stand dealing with money

01:35:30.090 --> 01:35:31.090
Monsters!

01:35:31.090 --> 01:35:35.880
Eh?

01:35:35.880 --> 01:35:36.340
What?

01:36:02.140 --> 01:36:03.640
I'm just totally panicking.

01:36:03.640 --> 01:36:04.840
That's a new one.

01:36:04.840 --> 01:36:12.370
Get it up! I can't do it! I can't! I can't! I can't deal with this! I can't! I can't deal with slugs! I can't!

01:36:12.370 --> 01:36:13.830
Give me some salt!

01:36:13.830 --> 01:36:15.880
Uh, salt?

01:36:15.880 --> 01:36:21.000
What's going on?

01:36:21.000 --> 01:36:25.360
Now that I think about it, when did Mr. Zelgottis disappear?

01:36:25.360 --> 01:36:29.940
Mr. Gowrie? Mr. Zelgottis?

01:36:38.320 --> 01:36:51.400
I hate slugs. I hate slugs. I hate slugs all gone.

01:36:51.400 --> 01:36:55.680
Yeah, but now we've got something much worse to deal with.

01:36:55.680 --> 01:37:00.000
If you want us to eat,

01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:06.370
with you we're gonna require a formal invitation I don't think that's what he

01:37:06.370 --> 01:37:12.790
has in mind hear me out and you need not fear sitting at this table hear you out

01:37:12.790 --> 01:37:29.090
won't you join me I don't think so

01:37:35.340 --> 01:37:36.340
You did very well.

01:37:36.340 --> 01:37:43.690
The bugs smell delicious when you burn them to a crisp, Mr. Zelgadis.

01:37:43.690 --> 01:37:44.690
To you, maybe.

01:37:44.690 --> 01:37:45.580
Huh?

01:37:45.580 --> 01:37:47.760
Well, come on.

01:37:47.760 --> 01:37:49.580
We can't hang around here all day.

01:37:49.580 --> 01:37:59.210
Huh?

01:37:59.210 --> 01:38:00.000
Look out!

01:38:12.600 --> 01:38:18.410
want is to collect people with power even if they aren't members of the

01:38:18.410 --> 01:38:25.430
monster race. That's why Atlas City Sorcerers Guild and Halciform caught my

01:38:25.430 --> 01:38:30.000
attention. Since you've arrived it's prudent to invite you to

01:38:30.000 --> 01:38:37.460
in as well. The name of Lina Inverse is well known among the monster race.

01:38:37.460 --> 01:38:39.220
Thanks for the compliment.

01:38:39.220 --> 01:38:45.360
If you so wish, you can make the Pledge of Immortality with me as Helsiform did.

01:38:45.360 --> 01:38:46.580
Immortality?

01:38:46.580 --> 01:38:54.740
Yes. And you may finally escape both the death, which plagues foolish humans, as well as their meaningless fate.

01:39:00.320 --> 01:39:02.400
Lina! Are you...

01:39:05.400 --> 01:39:11.400
Join us, and all your wishes will be granted. I swear upon this mask.

01:39:13.020 --> 01:39:14.980
