01:39:21.730 --> 01:39:25.550
Unfortunately, I prefer a story with a happier ending.

01:39:25.550 --> 01:39:28.130
All right!

01:39:28.130 --> 01:39:28.960
Flow broke.

01:39:43.240 --> 01:39:46.100
Boy, I'm glad you didn't take that Pledge of Immortality thing.

01:39:46.100 --> 01:39:47.890
Yes, I wouldn't.

01:39:47.890 --> 01:39:50.390
You should have a little more faith in me.

01:39:50.390 --> 01:39:52.810
Anyway, let's find that Pledge Stone.

01:39:56.250 --> 01:39:57.610
What is this place?

01:39:57.610 --> 01:40:00.000
It looks like some sort of laboratory.

01:40:00.670 --> 01:40:03.530
The Pledge Stone might be in here.

01:40:03.530 --> 01:40:06.910
Taramu and Demia?

01:40:06.910 --> 01:40:10.400
What the heck is going on here?

01:40:10.400 --> 01:40:12.040
Lina, come here!

01:40:33.450 --> 01:40:54.770
"Ah, welcome. I never thought you'd make it this far. Apparently, I underestimated your persistence."

01:41:11.710 --> 01:41:20.680
See I see why you want immortality so badly and why you need life energy. I can see what's going on here

01:41:26.560 --> 01:41:29.470
Yes, it's all for rubia here

01:41:33.360 --> 01:41:34.960
My one and only...

01:41:34.960 --> 01:41:36.040
Rubia?

01:41:36.040 --> 01:41:37.250
That's pretty.

01:41:37.250 --> 01:41:40.780
Yes, my greatest love.

01:41:40.780 --> 01:41:43.790
The only woman I'll ever love.

01:41:43.790 --> 01:41:45.180
Rubia.

01:41:45.180 --> 01:41:48.750
Rubia's smile made me want for nothing more.

01:41:48.750 --> 01:41:51.960
We lived every day in perfect happiness.

01:41:51.960 --> 01:41:53.080
But then...

01:42:40.200 --> 01:42:42.570
