01:42:42.570 --> 01:42:45.260
And I too was dying.

01:42:45.260 --> 01:42:46.610
But just then...

01:42:46.610 --> 01:42:48.840
Immortality?

01:42:54.420 --> 01:43:00.000
I will do everything.

01:43:00.000 --> 01:43:05.650
anything to bring Rubia back I have taken possession of eternity to try and

01:43:05.650 --> 01:43:12.110
replay that failed experiment hey I know why not just ask that monster to bring

01:43:12.110 --> 01:43:20.700
Rubia back to life don't ask for the impossible even one of the monster race

01:43:20.700 --> 01:43:30.000
cannot restore life where it has been lost all of this is for Rubia

01:43:30.000 --> 01:43:36.000
I'll transfer the life energy from your friends into Rubia, and bring her back to life!

01:43:36.000 --> 01:43:41.820
But Amelia!

01:43:41.820 --> 01:43:58.450
And the time for Rubia to awaken will come.

01:44:02.010 --> 01:44:03.840
Awaken, Rubia!

01:44:36.300 --> 01:44:38.290
First of all, we have to stop him.

01:44:38.290 --> 01:44:42.710
Sorry about your girlfriend, but we're taking Amelia and Zelgottis back.

01:44:42.710 --> 01:44:56.820
Unusual spell, summoning a jellyfish.

01:44:56.820 --> 01:44:59.700
Yeah, just don't ask me to tell you who taught it to me.

01:45:00.640 --> 01:45:01.600
Take your chance, get 'em!

01:45:01.600 --> 01:45:03.190
Gotcha!

01:45:03.190 --> 01:45:06.050
Watch it while you're at it.

01:45:06.050 --> 01:45:06.970
Huh?

01:45:06.970 --> 01:45:08.900
That's a lot to ask!

01:45:08.900 --> 01:45:11.920
I know it's a lot, but you have to do it while I buy us some time.

01:45:11.920 --> 01:45:14.140
Freeeeeee!

01:45:14.140 --> 01:45:15.300
Vowel flare!

01:45:30.410 --> 01:45:31.850
You won't interfere!

01:45:34.390 --> 01:45:38.130
He's... so... powerful.

01:45:41.070 --> 01:45:44.740
Fool.

01:45:44.900 --> 01:45:46.700
Why don't you finish them?

01:45:46.870 --> 01:45:49.820
I don't recall promising to follow your commands.

01:45:49.820 --> 01:45:52.240
Know your place, human.

01:46:02.940 --> 01:46:04.540
A pledge is a pledge.

01:46:07.710 --> 01:46:10.620
I swear upon this mask.

01:46:17.370 --> 01:46:18.770
Gowry, can you move?

01:46:18.970 --> 01:46:21.010
Oh, I can't take much more of this.

01:46:21.170 --> 01:46:22.170
Just listen to me.

01:46:23.740 --> 01:46:24.800
Are you serious?

01:46:25.020 --> 01:46:26.000
We have no choice.

01:46:26.510 --> 01:46:26.870
Got it?

01:46:28.260 --> 01:46:30.000
Now awaken, my beloved Ruby.

01:46:30.000 --> 01:46:36.450
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

01:46:36.450 --> 01:46:37.690
Support!

01:46:37.690 --> 01:46:42.040
I have one final challenge.

01:46:42.040 --> 01:46:43.040
Fascinating.

01:46:43.040 --> 01:46:45.040
FLAIR LAMP!

01:46:45.040 --> 01:46:47.040
Ballast wall!

01:46:47.040 --> 01:46:51.320
Above me?

01:46:51.320 --> 01:46:53.330
Clever, trying to hit from behind.

01:46:53.330 --> 01:46:55.790
Savor him, look out!

01:46:55.790 --> 01:46:56.710
Scout!

01:46:56.710 --> 01:46:57.530
- Get out.

01:46:57.530 --> 01:46:58.840
- Ah!

01:47:19.640 --> 01:47:22.240
I don't know what's happening, but here goes.

01:47:37.360 --> 01:47:51.570
Just as I thought. So Sagram's mask was the Pledge Stone after all.

01:48:11.070 --> 01:48:15.940
Rubia, you've finally come back to me?

01:48:15.940 --> 01:48:24.910
No, she's just being animated by the life energy.

01:48:24.910 --> 01:48:26.400
She's just a puppet now.

01:48:33.160 --> 01:48:34.340
Stop that.

01:48:34.340 --> 01:48:35.600
You.

01:48:35.600 --> 01:48:38.820
For your own sake, don't interfere, Mr. Sagram.

01:48:38.820 --> 01:48:40.280
Understand?

01:48:45.990 --> 01:48:50.900
Kill me, please.

01:48:50.900 --> 01:48:59.250
Rubea, forgive me, Rubea.

01:49:09.020 --> 01:49:16.930
Source of all power crimson fire burning bright gathering my hand and become an inferno first flare guys

01:49:30.480 --> 01:49:34.580
So, uh, that guy, was the Pledge of Immortality really what he wanted?

01:49:34.950 --> 01:49:37.600
Well, who can say, now?

01:49:38.670 --> 01:49:43.290
You let him completely burn up before finding a way to turn us back to normal?

01:49:43.550 --> 01:49:45.450
You people are completely useless!

01:49:45.970 --> 01:49:47.090
I'd watch what you say.

01:49:47.330 --> 01:49:48.850
Who do you think saved you, anyway?

01:49:49.010 --> 01:49:51.330
Although we were in cocoons at the time.

01:49:51.740 --> 01:49:53.920
Don't you remember, Mr. Zogadis?

01:49:54.100 --> 01:49:55.320
Don't mention that.

01:49:56.570 --> 01:50:00.000
Um, I suppose our payment is out of the question now.

01:50:00.440 --> 01:50:06.810
and we found no sign of the claire bible here and we ran into a monster so where do we go now

01:50:10.230 --> 01:50:16.310
walking and think of that later come on dal cheer up i just know we'll find the claire bible for you

01:50:16.310 --> 01:50:18.230
lena don't patronize me

01:52:00.000 --> 01:52:14.080
I want to try eating it, I'm sure

01:53:13.050 --> 01:53:18.130
the immortal Halseform, we had to sneak into his mansion and smash the Pledge Stone.

01:53:18.130 --> 01:53:23.050
At the last possible moment, we figured out that the Pledge Stone was Sagram's mask,

01:53:23.050 --> 01:53:25.350
and were able to defeat Halseform.

01:53:25.350 --> 01:53:26.690
And our payment for this?

01:53:26.690 --> 01:53:27.710
Nothing.

01:53:27.710 --> 01:53:30.000
I guess that's what you'd call a wasted effort.

01:53:31.880 --> 01:53:37.280
You can't escape! The return of the obsessive Martina!

01:53:37.280 --> 01:53:44.300
Well, we finally found it, Amelia.

01:53:44.300 --> 01:53:46.950
Yes, this is the thing we've dreamed of.

01:53:46.950 --> 01:53:50.130
The all-you-can-eat-for-a-silver-piece restaurant!

01:53:50.130 --> 01:53:51.900
Is your stomach ready?

01:53:51.900 --> 01:53:53.900
Yup, everything's A-OK!

01:53:53.900 --> 01:53:55.260
Then let's get going!

01:53:55.260 --> 01:53:56.890
Ready, set, go!

01:53:56.890 --> 01:53:58.410
Hold it just a minute.

01:53:58.410 --> 01:54:00.000
Are you trying to tell me we came

01:54:00.000 --> 01:54:03.980
all this way just so you could stuff your face, Lina-Inverse?

01:54:03.980 --> 01:54:05.120
- So what if we did?

01:54:05.120 --> 01:54:08.510
- I see.

01:54:08.510 --> 01:54:11.710
I told you I'm trying to get to Seirune as fast as possible

01:54:11.710 --> 01:54:14.410
so I can find a way to turn myself back to normal.

01:54:14.410 --> 01:54:17.510
I don't need to waste time traveling to get a big meal.

01:54:17.510 --> 01:54:19.350
- Oh, it's not just a big meal.

01:54:19.350 --> 01:54:21.150
It's all you can eat.

01:54:21.150 --> 01:54:23.430
- There's no harm in stopping here.

01:54:23.430 --> 01:54:26.020
Seirune isn't going to run away.

01:54:26.020 --> 01:54:28.790
- And just why again do you have to come with us?

01:54:28.790 --> 01:54:30.000
- Because I also have--

01:54:30.000 --> 01:54:32.980
happened to have some business in the direction of Seirune.

01:54:32.980 --> 01:54:35.370
What sort of business?

01:54:35.370 --> 01:54:37.080
That is a secret.

01:54:37.080 --> 01:54:41.080
I suppose it has something to do with looking for the Claire Bible manuscript?

01:54:41.080 --> 01:54:44.970
Well, that's one way of putting it. Anyway, until we meet again.

01:54:44.970 --> 01:54:45.880
Huh?

01:54:45.880 --> 01:54:48.990
Hey, wait!

01:54:48.990 --> 01:54:50.450
Huh?

01:54:50.450 --> 01:54:58.550
I hate to admit it, but we have absolutely no chance of catching him.

01:54:58.550 --> 01:55:00.000
Anyway, here we go!

01:55:00.190 --> 01:55:00.740
Ready, set!

01:55:01.650 --> 01:55:03.090
Please, wait a minute.

01:55:04.570 --> 01:55:04.870
Hmm?

01:55:05.570 --> 01:55:07.430
What is up with this girl?

01:55:08.300 --> 01:55:10.520
Yeah, she looks pretty shady.

01:55:11.220 --> 01:55:13.340
Oh, I like you so much.

01:55:13.640 --> 01:55:15.380
Wouldn't you like a gold coin?

01:55:17.090 --> 01:55:21.980
Hey, isn't that one of the legendary gold pieces of Raga?

01:55:22.200 --> 01:55:24.740
Oh, yes, I'd love to have that.

01:55:25.090 --> 01:55:28.330
Oh, well, then how about trading me something for it?

01:55:28.630 --> 01:55:30.000
Gets right to the point.

01:55:30.090 --> 01:55:30.990
Doesn't she?

01:55:30.990 --> 01:55:35.650
Show something shiny to Lina and she'll trade you just about anything for it.

01:55:35.650 --> 01:55:38.490
Okay, let's see. I need something to trade.

01:55:38.490 --> 01:55:40.190
This would do nicely.

01:55:40.190 --> 01:55:41.190
Hey! Um...

01:55:41.190 --> 01:55:43.140
Well, here you go. Bye-bye.

01:55:43.140 --> 01:55:44.040
Hey, wait!

01:55:44.040 --> 01:55:45.670
Wait!

01:55:45.670 --> 01:55:46.160
Huh?

01:55:46.160 --> 01:55:48.400
Huh?

01:55:48.400 --> 01:55:53.610
What happened?

01:55:53.610 --> 01:55:58.090
I don't really care if anyone steals the jewels on my shoulders since they're fake,

01:55:58.090 --> 01:56:00.000
but it's not my fault if they...

01:56:00.030 --> 01:56:13.640
When you remove them, huh? Hey, you don't you try to get away

01:56:15.760 --> 01:56:19.280
Yeah over here guys

01:56:19.280 --> 01:56:23.880
You're alive, and I caught the thief too. Look that's some thief

01:56:26.610 --> 01:56:30.000
For Pete's sake gallery you're as dumb as ever

01:56:30.860 --> 01:56:33.860
She didn't steal anything, so you didn't have to go after her.

01:56:33.860 --> 01:56:34.860
Let's go.

01:56:38.440 --> 01:56:41.350
Darn it! My plan failed!

01:56:41.350 --> 01:56:45.490
But it'll take more than this to make me give up.

01:56:45.490 --> 01:56:50.790
I will take one of Lina's possessions, no matter what.

01:56:51.790 --> 01:56:54.710
Ever since the day you destroyed my castle in Zona,

01:56:54.710 --> 01:57:00.000
I've lost my fortune, my kingdom, my home.

01:57:08.410 --> 01:57:16.060
